<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Sepap posts CZK 366.8 mln H1 gross.</title>
<headline>Czech Sepap posts CZK 366.8 mln H1 gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech pulp and paper producer Sepap a.s., majority owned by the Swedish paper group AssiDoman AB, said its first-half pre-tax profit totalled 366.8 million crowns, with net profit at 276 million crowns.</p>
<p>Comparative results for the six-month period were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
